{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 25,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 276.718,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, now it came to pass that those Lamanites were more angry",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.01,
      "end": 7.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they had slain their brethren;",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.373,
      "end": 10.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they swore vengeance upon the Nephites;",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.386,
      "end": 14.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did no more attempt to slay the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi at that time.",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.246,
      "end": 16.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they took their armies",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.051,
      "end": 20.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went over into the borders of the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.853,
      "end": 25.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fell upon the people who were in the land of Ammonihah and destroyed them.",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.084,
      "end": 29.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after that, they had many battles with the Nephites,",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.468,
      "end": 31.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which they were driven and slain.",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.516,
      "end": 34.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And among the Lamanites who were slain",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.111,
      "end": 38.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were almost all the seed of Amulon and his brethren,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 38.681,
      "end": 40.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were the priests of Noah,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.811,
      "end": 43.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were slain by the hands of the Nephites;",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.602,
      "end": 47.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the remainder, having fled into the east wilderness,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.126,
      "end": 52.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having usurped the power and authority over the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.439,
      "end": 57.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "caused that many of the Lamanites should perish by fire because of their belief\u2014",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.042,
      "end": 62.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For many of them, after having suffered much loss and so many afflictions,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 62.912,
      "end": 65.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "began to be stirred up in remembrance",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 65.786,
      "end": 70.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the words which Aaron and his brethren had preached to them in their land;",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 70.935,
      "end": 74.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they began to disbelieve the traditions of their fathers,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 75.155,
      "end": 76.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to believe in the Lord,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 76.96,
      "end": 79.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he gave great power unto the Nephites;",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 80.159,
      "end": 83.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus there were many of them converted in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 84.554,
      "end": 90.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that those rulers who were the remnant of the children of Amulon",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 90.446,
      "end": 93.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "caused that they should be put to death,",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 93.227,
      "end": 95.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all those that believed in these things.",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 96.415,
      "end": 101.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this martyrdom caused that many of their brethren should be stirred up to anger;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 101.332,
      "end": 104.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there began to be contention in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 105.088,
      "end": 111.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites began to hunt the seed of Amulon and his brethren",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 111.259,
      "end": 112.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to slay them;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 113.157,
      "end": 115.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they fled into the east wilderness.",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 116.113,
      "end": 119.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold they are hunted at this day by the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 119.451,
      "end": 125.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus the words of Abinadi were brought to pass, which he said concerning the seed of the priests",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.297,
      "end": 128.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who caused that he should suffer death by fire.",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 129.599,
      "end": 131.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he said unto them:",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 131.404,
      "end": 134.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What ye shall do unto me shall be a type of things to come.",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 135.567,
      "end": 141.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Abinadi was the first that suffered death by fire because of his belief in God;",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 141.227,
      "end": 142.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "now this is what he meant,",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 143.032,
      "end": 145.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that many should suffer death by fire,",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 145.906,
      "end": 147.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as he had suffered.",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 148.49,
      "end": 150.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto the priests of Noah",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 150.76,
      "end": 156.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their seed should cause many to be put to death, in the like manner as he was,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 156.559,
      "end": 159.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they should be scattered abroad and slain,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 159.665,
      "end": 164.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as a sheep having no shepherd is driven and slain by wild beasts;",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 164.628,
      "end": 167.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now behold, these words were verified,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 167.223,
      "end": 169.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were driven by the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 169.818,
      "end": 171.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were hunted, and they were smitten.",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 172.541,
      "end": 179.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the Lamanites saw that they could not overpower the Nephites",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 179.223,
      "end": 181.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they returned again to their own land;",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 181.771,
      "end": 186.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many of them came over to dwell in the land of Ishmael and the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 187.106,
      "end": 189.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did join themselves to the people of God,",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 189.98,
      "end": 192.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi.",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 193.214,
      "end": 195.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did also bury their weapons of war,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 195.995,
      "end": 198.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as their brethren had,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 198.218,
      "end": 200.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to be a righteous people;",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 200.627,
      "end": 203.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did walk in the ways of the Lord,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 203.547,
      "end": 207.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did observe to keep his commandments and his statutes.",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 207.896,
      "end": 210.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they did keep the law of Moses;",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 210.862,
      "end": 215.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was expedient that they should keep the law of Moses as yet,",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 215.361,
      "end": 217.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was not all fulfilled.",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 217.631,
      "end": 220.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But notwithstanding the law of Moses,",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 220.226,
      "end": 226.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did look forward to the coming of Christ, considering that the law of Moses was a type of his coming,",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 226.908,
      "end": 230.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and believing that they must keep those outward performances",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 230.803,
      "end": 233.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until the time that he should be revealed unto them.",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 234.409,
      "end": 238.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they did not suppose that salvation came by the law of Moses;",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 238.629,
      "end": 242.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the law of Moses did serve to strengthen their faith in Christ;",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 243.174,
      "end": 248.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they did retain a hope through faith, unto eternal salvation,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 248.648,
      "end": 251.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "relying upon the spirit of prophecy,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 251.243,
      "end": 253.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which spake of those things to come.",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 254.524,
      "end": 260.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, Ammon, and Aaron, and Omner, and Himni, and their brethren",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 260.416,
      "end": 262.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did rejoice exceedingly,",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 262.361,
      "end": 265.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the success which they had had among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 265.931,
      "end": 270.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing that the Lord had granted unto them according to their prayers,",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 270.43,
      "end": 276.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he had also verified his word unto them in every particular.",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    }
  ]
}